            "description_html": "<b>3\" Extended Lip Door Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n3\" extended full lip door latch strike plate. Packaged with matching finish #9 x 3/4\" wood screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in other sizes:  <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9115\">1-1/2 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-3-4-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9175\">1-3/4 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/2-1-2-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9125\">2-1/2 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin stainless steel, matte black and the dark bronze finishes have a stainless steel base metal. The polished brass, antique brass, antique nickel and satin nickel  finishes have a brass base metal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 9103 Extended Full Lip Door Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
